    "description": "280 AC Tyrion VII (Chapter 56) 18 House Lannister None Shae is a young camp follower who enters the service of Tyrion Lannister during the campaign against the Starks. Around eighteen years old, she is slim and slightly over five feet tall, with short dark hair, large dark eyes, and small, firm breasts. Her quick smile shifts easily—by turns shy, insolent, or wicked. Shae enjoys fine clothing and expensive jewelry, and though she can play the part of a demure companion, she is often bold and irreverent. Her charm lies in her adaptability, blending flirtation with subtle defiance.",
